@bank all
// Pillar 5 Step 4 (head writer W2): side jobs said by crew. cabin.remark: a visitor noticing something in your cabin (24t, E3; the flag
// names the spot). favour.thanks: the friend whose favour you solved (E2). roof.wait: crew waiting for the lift while it's held (M17, E3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
== favour.thanks
- You fixed it! I knew you would. Thank you.   #warm
- That's brilliant. I'd never have worked that out.
- Thank you. I owe you one. A big one.
? tier>=friend
- You're the best. Have this. No arguing.   #warm
== cabin.remark
? flag:cabin.lamp
- Nice lamp. Did you make that?
- That lamp's lovely. Very you.
? flag:cabin.rug
- Good rug. Warm under the feet.
- Ooh, a rug. Shoes off?   #funny
? flag:cabin.plant
- A plant! Is that from the garden? It looks happy.
? flag:cabin.shelf
- Look at your shelf. You've been busy.
? flag:cabin.made
- Did you make all this? In the shop?   #warm
== roof.wait
- Lift's held again. Thursday, isn't it.
- Stairs it is. Good for the legs, they say.   #funny
- Half four, the notice says. I'll wait.
- Somebody's up on the roof. Rather them than me.

